msgstr "«%1» é a única resolución que permite esta pantalla."

#. +> stable5
#: package/contents/ui/OutputPanel.qml:73
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"&quot;%1&quot; is the only resolution supported by this display.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"Using unsupported resolutions was possible in the Plasma X11 session, but"
" they were never guaranteed to work and are not available in this Plasma"
" Wayland session."
msgstr ""
"«%1» é a única resolución que permite esta pantalla.<nl/>"
"<nl/>"
"Usar resolucións incompatíbeis era posíbel na sesión de X11 de Plasma, pero"
" nunca se garantiu que funcionasen e non están dispoñíbeis nesta sesión de"
" Wayland de Plasma."

